<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrant on basket of China concept stocks.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrant on basket of China concept stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Monday it proposed to issue 130 million American-style call warrants on a basket of China concept stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p>  CITIC Pacific Ltd			 0.1 shares</p>
<p>  Ng Fung Hong Ltd			  0.8 shares</p>
<p>  China Resources Enterprise Ltd	0.4 shares</p>
<p>  New World Development Co Ltd	  0.1 shares</p>
<p>  Guangzhou Investment Co Ltd	   1.2 shares</p>
<p>  Kumagai Gumi (Hong Kong) Ltd	  0.4 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$22.822    PREMIUM	 9.88 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.668     GEARING	 4.02X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  09.DEC.97    PAYDATE	 23.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    MIN EXER LOT  50,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$26.85     LISTING DATE  27.DEC.96</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT ISSUER'S OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
